						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;">As of the date of this prospectus, we cannot specify with certainty all of the particular uses for the net proceeds to us from this offering. However, we currently intend to use the proceeds from this offering to increase marketing capabilities, increase production capacity, expand research and development, and other working capital and general corporate purposes, including working capital. See &#x201c;<FONT CLASS="Italic" STYLE="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">Use of Proceeds</FONT>&#x201d; beginning on page 36.</P>
